<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Lorain Cty Comm Coll Dist., Ohio.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Lorain Cty Comm Coll Dist., Ohio.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seasongood &amp; Mayer said it received the verbal award for the $10 million of Lorain County Community College Dist., Ohio, tax anticipation notes, with a top yield of 4.80 percent in 2004.</p>
</text>
